---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout pageId="competition">
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container page-hero__grid">
    <div><span class="eyebrow">Competition status</span><h1>No competition or showcase is scheduled.</h1><p class="page-hero__lead">Members have not approved an engineering competition or showcase. The society is focusing first on choosing and supporting student projects.</p><div class="page-hero__actions"><a class="button button--primary" href="projects#propose">Propose a project</a><a class="button button--secondary" href="join">Submit membership interest</a></div></div>
    <div class="page-hero__side"><figure class="page-hero__figure"><img src="assets/images/photos/solder-practice.jpg" width="1200" height="960" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" alt="A circuit board used for soldering practice"></figure><aside class="page-hero__aside"><strong>Nothing to register for</strong><p>There is no event date, venue, judging process, prize, or registration.</p></aside></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container split split--center">
    <div><span class="eyebrow">Current priority</span><h2>Projects come first.</h2><p>The society will first review project ideas, confirm teams, and determine which work can be supported. A showcase should appear here only after members approve one and confirm an organizer, date, venue, and safety plan.</p></div>
    <div class="page-hero__actions"><a class="button button--primary" href="projects">Review project selection</a></div>
  </div>
</section>
</Layout>
